 "applies_to": "LG PAHCMR000 AHU Communication Kit (R32 and R410A Multi V / single split outdoor units with a PRLK EEV kit), installation manual IM_AHU_Comm_Kit_PAHCMR000_R32_06_26.",
 "summary": "The PAHCMR000 kit lets a third-party air handler use an LG Multi V or single-split outdoor unit, and its RS485 CH1 port talks Modbus RTU directly to a DDC controller. Coils switch the unit and lock wired-controller functions, holding registers set mode, fan speed, target temperature and its limits, and discrete inputs and input registers report compressor, defrost and oil-return status, error code, return-air and coil temperatures.",
