 "addressing": {
  "convention": "Modicon",
  "note": "Points are printed as 00001/10001/30001/40001-style registers together with the function codes for each block (01/05 coils 00001-00008, 02 inputs 10001-10008, 04 input registers 30001-30008, 03/06 holding registers 40001-40010). The wire address is the printed number minus the block base: 40003 is holding register 2."
 },
