 },
 "notes": [
  "Reserved points (coils 00002 and 00008, inputs 10004-10008, input registers 30003, 30007-30008, holding 40006-40010) are left out.",
  "Access follows the function-code columns of the memory map: coil 00007 (Error) is read with 01 only; the other coils accept 01 and 05. Holding registers accept 03 and 06.",
  "Temperatures are sent multiplied by 10 and cover negative ranges, so they are listed as signed 16-bit.",
  "The manual does not print the data-bit setting; only 9600 bps, no parity and 1 stop bit are stated."
 ],
