   "Operation mode uses 0 = cooling, 2 = fan, 4 = heating (no auto value).",
   "Only function 06 is listed for writing holding registers and 05 for coils."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "RS485 CH1 to the DDC: 2-core 1.0-1.5 mm2 shielded cable, up to 500 m.",
   "9600 bps, no parity, 1 stop bit.",
   "The Modbus slave (sub) address follows the main module address setting described in the manual."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
